INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`, `Emote1`, `Emote2`, `Emote3`, `Emote4`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `EmoteDelay4`, `RewardText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Interesting, there may be something developing between the Twilight Runners that has made them more aggresive, but it could also be due to the overpopulation and need for food, thanks again. This has dispelled some worry for me with all of the nightmares I hear about back in Teldrassil.', 0),
(40608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ahh, ye done it!$B$BI be a bit too old to fight them off, it\'s a good thing you came around.', 0),
(40634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Bummer, I actually gotta work now.$B$BYeah, yeah, here\'s your pay.', 0),
(40635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Never thought you had it in you kid.$B$BSheesh, is that someone\'s gut? Ugh, working with amateurs.$B$BTake the coin and get out of my sight.', 0),
(40636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You made sure to leave some for my boys right?$B$BOne of the basilisks spit these after eating some of our townsfolk. Just take one.', 0),
(40637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Great work kid, knew you were the perfect idi- man for the job!$B$BRemember when I said some of my boys died? Well, you can have some of their stuff I guess.', 0),
(40639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Not, I repeat: NOT USELESS. Do you hear that you blasted maggots?$B$B<Nazz shouts for the whole town to hear.>$B$BI SAY IT AGAIN, NOT USELESS! UNLIKE THE LOT OF YOU.', 0),
(40640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Great job kid, you deliver yet again!', 0),
(40641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Quick take it out and place it on the ground.$B$B<Nash grins.>$B$BFinally got my own shredder.', 0),
(40642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Astounding work $N.', 0),
(40643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You took it! You took the candle! He was real.$B$BKABOOOOOOOM$B$BSorry about that, my excitement is as explosive as this bomb.', 0),
(40644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah so someone did go and collect, great, great, this should turn a good profit.', 0),
(40645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Oy! Oh, ale? Cheapskate. Meh, thanks, kid.', 0),
(40646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Sheesh Gig, not again. Sorry about that kid, Gig\'s a special sort. Great when he\'s sober, but he hasn\'t been sober once ever since we came here. His paranoia took over. Nobody\'s blowing us up, don\'t worry about nothing.$B$BHere\'s something for the trouble.$B$BGolddammit Gig.', 0),
(40647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'These will do perfectly!$B$BYou have my appreciation, this will surely be very useful.', 0),
(40691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Now you see why it is I traveled so far?$B$BI will reclaim my families glory.', 0),
(40692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<The sight of the axe nearly brings a tear to Grumnir\'s eyes.>$B$BI cannot believe it, after all of these years, and finally before me again.$B$BYou have honored our family beyond belief, and given me justice, and relief.$B$BI will not forget this moment $N.', 0),
(40693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Flinthammer\'s goggles begin to fog up.>$B$BOh by sweet Ironforge!$B$BThat is it, it really is it! I can\'t believe you went and recovered the thing, good and honest work you did for me.$B$BHere, take these, and some coin on top. Maybe I can find a new place to look for rare crystals now.$B$BAll thanks to you of course.', 0),
(40694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ahh, now lets see...$B$B<Harlek takes his time, inspecting the part over.>$B$BBlasted, it would appear the part took even more damage during my retreat from the assaulting birds... I will need some specialized equipment if I am to have a chance at getting my turbo-charge beauty back in the sky.$B$BOh, about that ale, I had one, sorry about that, a troubled mind is a thirsty mind, as they say.', 0),
(40695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Harlek sent you?$B$B<Tansi lets out a sigh.>$B$BThis is the fourth time in the past few weeks he has asked for my assistance with parts, that flying machine of his keeps breaking down.', 0),
(40696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Harlek Vaultshield visibly lights up.>$B$BHaha! I am free to fly again, a savant of the skies to soar once more!$B$BThanks to you and Tansi I am no longer land locked.$B$BGood work $C.', 0),
(40697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Why, I must say, you have certainly gone above and beyond what I have asked, this is quite a perfect specimen, and will help me with my work.', 0),
(40698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I am once again left with more questions...$B$B<Maloran clutches his jaw, musing to himself in thought.>$B$BMore work will be needed to uncover a solution to the problem.', 0),
(40699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You honor your word, and so I will honor mine.', 0),
(40700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It eases my mind to know that we may just be a little more safe in our, somewhat isolated position, I thank ye for that.', 0),
(40701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You certainly have eased a troubled mind. Many a stronger dwarf than me fell at the hands of Gorras, and I hoped not to be another.$B$BI thank you for everything you’ve done for us. Take this, as a token of my thanks.', 0),
(40702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'By my beard, I must say, this is astounding work.$B$BHopefully they will get the memo and leave Windshear Crag for good.', 0),
(40704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Immaculate condition, not really sure what they\'re worth, but, it\'ll be something. Thanks for the trouble $C.', 0),
(40705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ahh finally! A chance to pack up and get back on the road, here, take some silver for the effort, you may have saved my job.', 0),
(40706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Your efforts are truly spectacular, without your help, I am not sure how we would have been able to put an end to the Venture Co. within the Blacksand Oil Fields.$B$BI must thank you, and from the bottom of my heart, perhaps we may bring balance to Stonetalon after all.', 0),
(40707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'They will think twice when placing their hands upon sacred land, we will not stand aside any longer.', 0),
(41127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Aye, so Delgren sent ya, did he? Ha, that lad\'s a good one, fought by me side in the Third War, he did, under the command of Lady Jaina, bless her heart.$B$BBut enough of me ramblin\' about the past like an old dwarf. There be plenty of work to be done, and we best get to it, sharpish! No time to waste, laddie!', 0),
(41209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hmm...$B$B<Dalanas takes his time looking over the document>$B$BIt would appear most of their efforts have been focused at the Blacksand Oil Fields, but there are potential plans for future developments. You have done well in recovering this from that worksite. Take these coins, as a contribution from us here at Stonetalon Peak.', 0),
(41210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Why, look at this. It seems they did find something after all. It\'s a good thing we snatched it right out from under them.$B$BGood work with the mission mercenary, take some coin as payment for the good work. We Durotar Labor Union members pay for a job well done.', 0),
(41211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I see you returned, and visibly strengthened by your venture. I take it the mine is cleared? You\'ve done a commendable service to the Horde today. News will be sent to Orgrimmar of your deeds - with resources dwindling more and more, the Warchief will acknowledge your ambitious nature, I am certain of it.', 0),
(41212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It is as I feared. The same faint breath of foul magic permeates these brains. Yet it may be even stronger within the spiders of the Broken Cliff Mine. I wonder, what may be the reason? Perhaps them living underground is one of the key factors here. I need to convene with Faldan about this and my findings, we have much to discuss.$B$BNevertheless, you helped me greatly in my research. Still, there is much to do to get behind this conundrum, and for the sake of Kalimdor, we have to solve it as quickly as possible.', 0),
(41213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Our war with the Venture Co. is one step closer to victory. No thanks to your actions of course. Here, take this, as a thanks from myself.', 0),
(41641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'A splendid display of your abilities, $C. I can see that you comprehend the fundamental teachings of shamanism, atleast when it comes to its utilization in combat. Thank you for lending a hand; I will relay what has happened to Far Seer Earthfury. It is our duty to nature and the spirits to ensure the elemental chaos is kept in check. It will take time, and perhaps your help again in the future, to uncover what Al\'akir\'s minions are scheming. Balance has to be maintained, at all costs.', 0),
(41938, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This writing is in Kalimag, the language of the elements. Not many know of this language, let alone speak or read it. It is good you came to me, as I can indeed read a few words on it.', 0),
(41939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Vortalus, you say? Worrisome to see elementals making a pact in such large numbers with the mortal races. Especially after what had happened here, at the Earthen Ring. This begs another question, however. What do the elements expect of such a coalition? Were they servants of the Blackwind tribe or was it the other way around? If the wind lords are bringing other forces under their fold, then they must be preparing for something greater.$B$B$N, thank you for your courage. You’ve done something incredible today and shown your potential as an aspiring shaman of our order. The others are surely expecting more great things from you.', 0),
(41943, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The elements have spoken of your return, $N. It will take time before the waters are pure again. But with no further corruption being funneled into Maraudon anymore, nature can do so in serenity and peace.$B$BTake this for your deeds in restoring balance to Azeroth.', 0),
(80301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The foul stench be starting to clear. Ya did good mon. Ya deserve a reward for ya efforts.$B$BKnow that in time, this place will not only be an asset to the Revantusk, but the Horde as a whole.', 0),
(80303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You\'ve proven your worth yet again, $C. We may not have been able to recover what they stole, but at least we set them back from launching their expedition.', 0),
(80313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Good, good. We be having much to do, so don\'t go scurrying yet mon.', 0),
(80314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I haven\'t gotten one of these in years, mon. Do ya understand the meaning of this gesture?$B$BThis be a voodoo doll of Warleader Zol\'majin himself, given in confidence to another troll. This doll will eventually reach Vol\'jin, so Zol\'majin be putting his life in the hands of the Darkspear.$B$BThis be a symbol of great trust between the tribes. This gesture may be returned in kind with time.', 0),
(80360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It will take time for our loa to begin to feel as if this is their home, just as it will take time for us to accept it as ours. We will grow together and nurture their spirits while they safeguard our homes. Halazzi\'s cunning keep your wits, until then.', 0),
(80375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, $N!', 0),
(80376, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, $N!', 0),
(80377, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, $N!', 0),
(80378, 4, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Fantastic - these will go right to use, I assure you. Thank you again for your assistance! We\'d certainly be lost without you.$B$BWith all the donations you\'ve made, I would certainly process any additional runecloth donations you care to make in the future. Just be sure to check in with me, and I\'ll personally make sure that your good deeds won\'t go unrecognized!', 0),
(80379, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Greetings once again, $N! Our need for runecloth is constant, and we can always use additional resources if you are willing to part with them. For an additional stack of twenty runecloth, I will make sure that you are recognized for your continuing efforts on behalf of Amani\'alor.', 0);
INSERT INTO `quest_request_items` (`ID`, `EmoteOnComplete`, `EmoteOnIncomplete`, `CompletionText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40227, 0, 0, 'The Twilight Runners can be aggresive, so keep your wits about you.', 0),
(40608, 0, 0, 'We can\'t take all day now, if you wait too long they might eat it all up.', 0),
(40634, 0, 0, 'How am I supposed to fix not one but -TWO- shredders with no parts?!?', 0),
(40635, 0, 0, 'Too difficult for you, chum?', 0),
(40636, 0, 0, 'I saw some poor kid getting eaten by one of those things yesterday.$B$BHorrifying sight, funny, but horrifying.', 0),
(40637, 0, 0, 'So, has the ground settled yet?', 0),
(40639, 0, 0, 'Hurry it up bub, you wouldn\'t want me to finish sharpening this dagger.', 0),
(40640, 0, 0, 'Any of them zapped you?', 0),
(40641, 0, 0, 'Remember this! It won\'t stay shrunk for a long time, so hurry it up!', 0),
(40642, 0, 0, 'Goblin on Goblin, I wonder if this is also in our nature, $N.', 0),
(40643, 0, 0, 'You need to take candle!', 0),
(40644, 0, 0, 'I hope your back holds kid.', 0),
(40645, 0, 0, 'What?', 0),
(40646, 0, 0, 'Yeah?', 0),
(40647, 0, 0, 'Have you found their twisted forms?', 0),
(40691, 0, 0, 'There is a reason for me being here, beyond all else.', 0),
(40692, 0, 0, 'Each second that orc breaths is longer that my family remains dishonored.', 0),
(40693, 0, 0, 'Windshear Gemstone....Oh, what a beauty that\'d be aye?', 0),
(40694, 0, 0, 'Grounded, unable to soar the sky! I lament at such dark times.', 0),
(40695, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40696, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40697, 0, 0, 'There is no doubt in my mind that nature is being disturbed.', 0),
(40698, 0, 0, 'Have you heard news?', 0),
(40699, 0, 0, 'My hands are eager for some practice, have you had any luck?', 0),
(40700, 0, 0, 'Have you dealt with the dead $R?', 0),
(40701, 0, 0, 'Gorras Thorncrusher will not cease, and must be dealt with.', 0),
(40702, 0, 0, 'Have the Venture Company been removed as a threat?', 0),
(40704, 0, 0, 'So, you get those cuffs?', 0),
(40705, 0, 0, 'Had any luck yet?', 0),
(40706, 0, 0, 'Has it been done $C?', 0),
(40707, 0, 0, 'If we do not act decisively, the world will continue to be devastated and exploited for the Venture Company\'s profits.', 0),
(41127, 0, 0, 'Aye? I did not expect a visitor today.', 0),
(41209, 0, 0, 'So, have you found anything of value?', 0),
(41210, 0, 0, 'So, you have any luck finding anythin\'?', 0),
(41211, 0, 0, 'The Deepmoss spiders are a menace to the Stonetalon Mountains. Too often have they ambushed innocent travelers making their way through these treacherous cliffs.', 0),
(41212, 0, 0, '$N, how does your search for samples fare?', 0),
(41213, 0, 0, 'Our security depends on your actions, get to it!', 0),
(41641, 0, 0, 'Their hostility appears unreasonable. I wonder, what is their motive?', 0),
(41938, 0, 0, 'What can I help you with?', 0),
(41939, 0, 0, 'Our Far Seers and speakers are concerned about the elemental unrest boiling all around us. Even the trainees and initiates feel that uneasiness. All the more reason to get to the bottom of this.', 0),
(41943, 0, 0, 'The Satyrs are a plague upon Azeroth. Their machinations for their dark lords have disrupted the balance numerous times.', 0),
(80301, 0, 0, 'Is it done? Have the spirits been put to rest?', 0),
(80303, 0, 0, 'Did you manage to recover any trinkets? Tell me of your battles.', 0),
(80314, 0, 0, 'Ya mon? Ya say ya got something for me?', 0),
(80360, 0, 0, 'Akil\'darah has blessed the winds at your back with what strength she has.', 0),
(80375, 1, 0, 'We are currently accepting donations for wool cloth. A donation of sixty pieces of wool cloth will net you full recognition by Amani\'alor for your generous actions. Our stores are such on wool that we would only need sixty pieces from you total; we should be able to acquire enough from others in the realm to support our drive.$B$BIf you have the sixty pieces of wool cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I\'m able to take them from you now.', 0),
(80376, 1, 1, 'As with most other fabrics, our stocks of silk are at an all-time low. Our stores are such that we\'d only need sixty pieces of silk from you total; we should be able to reach our goal with the support of others.$B$BA benevolent gift such as silk, might I add, would certainly increase your local standing in the community! If you have the sixty pieces of silk cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I\'m able to take them from you now.', 0),
(80377, 1, 1, 'Mageweave is running low, and we could use your help to replenish our stocks!  By counting on the community as a whole, we would only need a donation of 60 pieces of mageweave cloth from you to enable us to reach our goal.  Such generosity would not go unnoticed by the Amani\'Alor, I assure you!$B$BIf you have the sixty pieces of mageweave cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I\'m able to take them from you now.', 0),
(80378, 1, 1, '$N, you\'ve been a tremendous contributor to our cloth drive. As we work hard to replenish our reserves, one form of cloth remains critically low - runecloth. We are in absolutely dire need of it, and we hope that you will be able to help us as you have in the past!$B$BIf you are willing, please bring me what runecloth you can spare. We\'ll initially accept a single donation of sixty, and then we\'ll go from there.', 0),
(80379, 1, 1, 'Whenever you are ready to hand in the stack of runecloth, I\'ll accept it.', 0);
